  "releaseNotes": "1. 支持AOT编译；2. 支持emoji分词；3. 支持繁体中文分词；4. 使用System.Text.Json替代Newtonsoft.Json",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "AOTba is an AOT-friendly port of jieba.NET Chinese text segmenter with emoji support. AOTba是支持AOT编译和emoji分词的jieba.NET分支。",
  "title": "AOTba - AOT-friendly Chinese Text Segmenter",
